Ted is still really cool, but the problem here is that those people who
took his essay seriously destroyed their computers and ran off to live
in shacks in the woods.  His ideas still circulate among some fringe
Amish-like hippie commune cults, but since they don't use the Internet
or even paper because it kills trees, you won't read about it here.

