attention to him at all was because he was a mad bomber whose story was
just sensational enough to be exploited for infotainment.  Sadly, while
his ideas enjoyed their fifteen minutes of fame, they were quickly
drowned in a sea of porn, beheading videos, and Nigerian spam.

